#: dahu-retention-lock.php:225
msgid "A blocked deletion says who tried and why it was refused."
msgstr "Une suppression bloquée dit qui a essayé et pourquoi elle est refusée."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:434
msgid "A cleanup run is in progress, or was left that way."
msgstr "Un nettoyage est en cours, ou a été laissé dans cet état."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:220
msgid "A rule, not a habit"
msgstr "Une règle, pas une habitude"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:441
msgid "Action Scheduler is not available"
msgstr "Action Scheduler n'est pas disponible"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:214
msgid "All six delays below are read as empty and the daily cleanup is unhooked. You can type a value: it will not be saved, and the attempt will be recorded."
msgstr "Les six délais ci-dessous sont lus comme vides et la tâche quotidienne est décrochée. Vous pouvez saisir une valeur : elle ne sera pas enregistrée, et la tentative sera inscrite."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:435
msgid "An in-progress action cannot be cancelled; it will finish or be cleaned up by Action Scheduler. It finds nothing to delete while the lock is on."
msgstr "Une action en cours ne peut pas être annulée ; elle se terminera ou sera nettoyée par Action Scheduler. Elle ne trouve rien à supprimer tant que le verrou est fermé."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-lock.php:71
msgid "Anonymise completed orders"
msgstr "Anonymiser les commandes terminées"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-lock.php:70
msgid "Anonymise refunded orders"
msgstr "Anonymiser les commandes remboursées"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:418
msgid "Anything still attached to the cleanup hook:"
msgstr "Quelque chose est-il encore accroché au crochet de nettoyage :"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-lock.php:69
msgid "Bin cancelled orders"
msgstr "Mettre à la corbeille les commandes annulées"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-lock.php:68
msgid "Bin failed orders"
msgstr "Mettre à la corbeille les commandes échouées"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-lock.php:67
msgid "Bin orders awaiting payment"
msgstr "Mettre à la corbeille les commandes en attente de paiement"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:473
msgid "By"
msgstr "Par"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:499
msgid "Clear the record"
msgstr "Effacer le relevé"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:383
msgid "Clear the stored delays"
msgstr "Vider les délais stockés"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:264
msgid "Clear them first"
msgstr "Videz-les d'abord"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:95
msgid "Dahu Retention Lock needs WooCommerce. It is doing nothing until WooCommerce is active."
msgstr "Dahu Retention Lock a besoin de WooCommerce. Il ne fait rien tant que WooCommerce n'est pas actif."

#. translators: 1: the setting's name, 2: the delay that was refused, e.g. "36 months". */
#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-lock.php:354
msgid "Dahu Retention Lock refused a retention delay: %1$s (%2$s). Nothing was saved, and the attempt was recorded."
msgstr "Dahu Retention Lock a refusé un délai de conservation : %1$s (%2$s). Rien n'a été enregistré, et la tentative a été inscrite."

#. translators: %d: how many delays are stored. */
#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:259
msgid "Deactivating this plugin puts %d stored WooCommerce retention delay back into force, and your order history starts being anonymised again."
msgid_plural "Deactivating this plugin puts %d stored WooCommerce retention delays back into force, and your order history starts being anonymised again."
msgstr[0] "Désactiver cette extension remet %d délai de conservation WooCommerce en vigueur, et votre historique de commandes recommence à être anonymisé."
msgstr[1] "Désactiver cette extension remet %d délais de conservation WooCommerce en vigueur, et votre historique de commandes recommence à être anonymisé."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-lock.php:72
msgid "Delete inactive customer accounts"
msgstr "Supprimer les comptes clients inactifs"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:188
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Terminé"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:205
msgid "It is off until you decide. Nothing is locked before then."
msgstr "Il est éteint jusqu'à votre décision. Rien n'est verrouillé avant."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:313
msgid "Lock WooCommerce's personal data retention"
msgstr "Verrouiller la conservation des données personnelles de WooCommerce"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:187
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Suivant"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:463
msgid "Nothing refused yet; every deletion the lock turns away is listed here."
msgstr "Rien de refusé pour l'instant ; chaque suppression écartée par le verrou est listée ici."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:228
msgid "Nothing silent"
msgstr "Rien de muet"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:213
msgid "Personal data retention: these fields are locked."
msgstr "Conservation des données personnelles : ces champs sont verrouillés."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:340
msgid "Read straight from the database, past the lock. This is what is stored, not what WooCommerce currently sees."
msgstr "Lu directement en base, par-delà le verrou. C'est ce qui est stocké, pas ce que WooCommerce voit actuellement."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:224
msgid "Refusals are visible"
msgstr "Les refus sont visibles"

#. translators: 1: the setting's name, 2: the delay that was refused. */
#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:484
msgid "Refused: %1$s (%2$s)"
msgstr "Refusé : %1$s (%2$s)"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:385
msgid "Removes the delays above from WooCommerce's settings. Nothing else is touched, and no order data is changed."
msgstr "Retire les délais ci-dessus des réglages de WooCommerce. Rien d'autre n'est touché, et aucune donnée de commande n'est modifiée."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:167 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:90 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:91 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:287
msgid "Retention lock"
msgstr "Verrou de conservation"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:221
msgid "Say how long, and the rule holds for every path."
msgstr "Dites combien de temps, et la règle vaut pour tous les chemins."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:439
msgid "Scheduled through Action Scheduler:"
msgstr "Programmée via Action Scheduler :"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:449
msgid "Scheduled through WP-Cron:"
msgstr "Programmée via WP-Cron :"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:122
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Réglages"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:189
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Passer"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:168 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:288
msgid "Stops anything deleting the records you are required to keep."
msgstr "Empêche quoi que ce soit de supprimer les écritures que vous devez conserver."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:347
msgid "Stored delay"
msgstr "Délai stocké"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:204
msgid "Switch the lock on"
msgstr "Activez le verrou"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:321
msgid "Switching the lock off, or deactivating this plugin, would put %d stored delay back into force on the next request."
msgid_plural "Switching the lock off, or deactivating this plugin, would put %d stored delays back into force on the next request."
msgstr[0] "Ouvrir le verrou, ou désactiver cette extension, remettrait %d délai stocké en vigueur dès la requête suivante."
msgstr[1] "Ouvrir le verrou, ou désactiver cette extension, remettrait %d délais stockés en vigueur dès la requête suivante."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:214 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:414
msgid "The daily cleanup"
msgstr "La tâche quotidienne"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:309
msgid "The lock"
msgstr "Le verrou"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:396
msgid "The lock is off, so none of the six settings above is locked either."
msgstr "Le verrou est éteint, donc aucun des six réglages ci-dessus n'est verrouillé non plus."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:465
msgid "The lock is off, so nothing is being refused."
msgstr "Le verrou est éteint, donc rien n'est refusé."

#. translators: %s: a link to this plugin's settings screen. */
#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:218
msgid "The lock is there because a delay typed here goes on anonymising your history <em>continuously and without warning</em>. To lift it, switch it off in %s — once you have written the retention policy that replaces it."
msgstr "Le verrou existe parce qu'un délai saisi ici anonymise ensuite votre historique <em>en continu et sans avertissement</em>. Pour le lever, ouvrez-le dans %s — une fois écrite la politique de conservation qui le remplace."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:229
msgid "The lock never pretends a deletion happened."
msgstr "Le verrou ne fait jamais croire qu’une suppression a eu lieu."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:210
msgid "The six delays WooCommerce would act on, read past the lock."
msgstr "Les six délais sur lesquels WooCommerce agirait, lus par-delà le verrou."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:394
msgid "The six settings above are still locked. What cannot be checked is whether this version of WooCommerce has added a seventh."
msgstr "Les six réglages ci-dessus restent verrouillés. Ce qui ne peut pas être vérifié, c'est si cette version de WooCommerce en a ajouté un septième."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:325
msgid "They are listed below. Use the button under the table to clear them — while the lock is on, WooCommerce's own field shows blank and a save there cannot remove them."
msgstr "Ils sont listés ci-dessous. Employez le bouton sous le tableau pour les vider : tant que le verrou est fermé, le champ de WooCommerce s'affiche vide et un enregistrement là-bas ne peut pas les retirer."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:407
msgid "They are not locked. Please report them so the list can be updated — a lock that quietly misses a field is worse than no lock, because nobody looks again."
msgstr "Ils ne sont pas verrouillés. Merci de les signaler pour que la liste soit mise à jour : un verrou qui rate un champ en silence est pire que pas de verrou, parce que plus personne ne va vérifier."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:404
msgid "This version of WooCommerce has retention settings this plugin does not know about."
msgstr "Cette version de WooCommerce a des réglages de conservation que cette extension ne connaît pas."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:472
msgid "What"
msgstr "Quoi"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:348
msgid "What WooCommerce reads"
msgstr "Ce que WooCommerce lit"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:337
msgid "What WooCommerce would do"
msgstr "Ce que WooCommerce ferait"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:209
msgid "What is stored"
msgstr "Ce qui est conservé"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:346
msgid "What it would delete"
msgstr "Ce qu'il supprimerait"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:459
msgid "What the lock refused"
msgstr "Ce que le verrou a refusé"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:471
msgid "When"
msgstr "Quand"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:215
msgid "Whether the job that deletes is still scheduled."
msgstr "Si la tâche qui supprime est toujours planifiée."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:219
msgid "WooCommerce → Retention lock"
msgstr "WooCommerce → Verrou de conservation"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:392
msgid "WooCommerce's own code could not be read, so this plugin cannot tell you whether it is still locking everything."
msgstr "Le code de WooCommerce n'a pas pu être lu, donc cette extension ne peut pas vous dire si elle verrouille encore tout."

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:191
msgid "You are not allowed to view this page."
msgstr "Vous n’avez pas l’autorisation de voir cette page."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:273
msgid "You do not have permission to change these settings."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas l'autorisation de modifier ces réglages."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:146 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:174
msgid "You do not have permission to do that."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas l'autorisation de faire cela."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:429 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:444 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:451
msgid "no"
msgstr "non"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:360
msgid "none"
msgstr "aucun"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:369
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "rien"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:367
msgid "nothing — locked"
msgstr "rien — verrouillé"

#: dahu-retention-lock.php:190
msgid "of"
msgstr "sur"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-log.php:98
msgid "the site"
msgstr "le site"

#. translators: %d: a numeric user id. */
#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-log.php:105
msgid "user #%d"
msgstr "utilisateur n° %d"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:420 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:444 includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:451
msgid "yes"
msgstr "oui"

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:422
msgid "— WooCommerce's own, which this plugin knows how to remove."
msgstr "— celui de WooCommerce, que cette extension sait retirer."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:426
msgid "— but not WooCommerce's own, and the lock is off. That callback is not this plugin's to remove."
msgstr "— mais pas celui de WooCommerce, et le verrou est éteint. Ce rappel n'appartient pas à cette extension."

#: includes/class-dahu-retention-lock-settings.php:424
msgid "— but not WooCommerce's own. Something else is on that hook; the six settings are still locked, and that callback is not this plugin's to remove."
msgstr "— mais pas celui de WooCommerce. Autre chose est accroché là ; les six réglages restent verrouillés, et ce rappel n'appartient pas à cette extension."

